{"id":"1234291ff963e08e","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint-compat.md","title":"Compatibility statement","display":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction — Compatibility statement","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint-compat","aliases":["16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint-compat","16-thm--dep-quantifier-adjoint"],"display":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction — Compatibility statement","depends_on":["[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint-compat</span><span>16-thm--dep-quantifier-adjoint</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction — Compatibility statement"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e59beb3704642c3f\" href=\"?note=e59beb3704642c3f\" title=\"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint\">16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(p,\\chi)\">\\((p,\\chi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_\\chi\">\\(D_\\chi\\)</span> 与所选伴随族满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e59beb3704642c3f\" href=\"?note=e59beb3704642c3f\" title=\"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint\">16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint</a> 的全部假设。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\sigma}:\\{\\sigma\\}\\to\\Gamma\">\\(\\pi_{\\sigma}:\\{\\sigma\\}\\to\\Gamma\\)</span> 为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 的理解投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\sigma}\\in D_\\chi\">\\(\\pi_{\\sigma}\\in D_\\chi\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\pi_{\\sigma}},\\Pi_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}:\\mathcal P_{\\{\\sigma\\}}\\to\\mathcal P_\\Gamma\">\\(\\Sigma_{\\pi_{\\sigma}},\\Pi_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}:\\mathcal P_{\\{\\sigma\\}}\\to\\mathcal P_\\Gamma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_{\\sigma}^*:\\mathcal P_\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\{\\sigma\\}}\">\\(\\pi_{\\sigma}^*:\\mathcal P_\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\{\\sigma\\}}\\)</span> 使用该同一伴随见证。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}\\dashv\\pi_{\\sigma}^*\\dashv\\Pi_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}\\dashv\\pi_{\\sigma}^*\\dashv\\Pi_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是主定理在理解投影上的实例；不把任意码族集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U^\\Gamma\">\\(U^\\Gamma\\)</span> 当作已封闭的类型纤维，也不省略伴随存在假设。自然 Hom 双射及预序版本见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e59beb3704642c3f\" href=\"?note=e59beb3704642c3f\" title=\"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint\">16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint","status":"resolved","id":"e59beb3704642c3f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint","status":"resolved","id":"e59beb3704642c3f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(p,\\chi)$、$q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B$、$D_\\chi$ 与所选伴随族满足 [[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]] 的全部假设。$\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B$、$\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma$，$\\pi_{\\sigma}:\\{\\sigma\\}\\to\\Gamma$ 为同一 $\\chi$ 的理解投影，$\\pi_{\\sigma}\\in D_\\chi$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint","status":"resolved","id":"e59beb3704642c3f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是主定理在理解投影上的实例；不把任意码族集合 $U^\\Gamma$ 当作已封闭的类型纤维，也不省略伴随存在假设。自然 Hom 双射及预序版本见 [[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"D_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal E_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\sigma}:\\{\\sigma\\}\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\sigma}\\in D_\\chi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\pi_{\\sigma}},\\Pi_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}:\\mathcal P_{\\{\\sigma\\}}\\to\\mathcal P_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_{\\sigma}^*:\\mathcal P_\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal P_{\\{\\sigma\\}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}\\dashv\\pi_{\\sigma}^*\\dashv\\Pi_{\\pi_{\\sigma}}.","display":true},{"tex":"U^\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1301,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-409","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint-compat|thm-dependent-quantifier-adjunction — Compatibility statement]]"}],"outgoing":["e59beb3704642c3f"]}